    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oathbound takes you on a casual, self-guided, journey through the trials of becoming a God. It is a relaxing world with your only directive being, climb the Celestial Spire! Enjoy solving riddles, making puzzling jumps, or finding sequences to unlock the way up. Will you be able to figure out how to climb the spire, or will you become just another faded away memory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oathbound takes you on a casual, self-guided, journey through the trials of becoming a God. It is a relaxing world with your only directive being, climb the Celestial Spire! Enjoy solving riddles, making puzzling jumps, or finding sequences to unlock the way up. Will you be able to figure out how to climb the spire, or will you become just another faded away memory?</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person casual adventure/ puzzle game. You are immersed in a beautiful land with not much direction but one, find a way to climb the tower and meet the dying god. You will need to think outside the box, land puzzling jumps, and remember what you see to progress.",
